  "answer": "This looks like PowerToys#48907. In that ticket, enabled and disabled modules were reset to their defaults after each update (0.100, 0.100.1 and 0.100.2), and a second user confirmed it. Your Store install probably auto-updates in the background, which would explain why modules come back on after a few days. The archive has no fix or workaround for it, and that ticket is still open. Check whether the re-enabling lines up with a PowerToys update. Then switch the unwanted modules off again, and add your bug report ZIP and update timing to #48907. Older tickets with similar symptoms (#4523, #37440) describe a reset on restart rather than after days, so they are not the same problem."
 },
